## API Pattern Selection Guide

### Khi nào nên dùng REST?

- CRUD operations đơn giản
- Fixed data structures
- Caching với HTTP standards
- Public APIs
- Low complexity requirements

### Khi nào nên dùng GraphQL?

- Flexible queries từ clients
- Multiple data sources aggregation
- Mobile apps (bandwidth optimization)
- Complex nested relationships
- Rapid iteration needed

### Khi nào nên dùng gRPC?

- High performance requirements
- Internal microservices communication
- Strong typing với Protocol Buffers
- Bi-directional streaming
- Low latency critical systems

### Khi nào nên dùng API Gateway?

- Multiple microservices
- Centralized authentication/authorization
- Rate limiting across services
- Request routing và transformation
- API versioning

### Khi nào nên dùng Service Mesh?

- Complex microservice topology
- Service-to-service encryption needed
- Advanced traffic management
- Distributed tracing requirements
- mTLS enforcement needed

